      "extract": "The Reshetikhin-Turaev invariants are a family of link-invariants constructed from the representation theory of quantum groups \\cite{RT90}. Examples of such invariants include the HOMFLY-PT polynomial and the colored Jones polynomial. Following Khovanov's pioneering work categorifying the Jones polynomial \\cite{K00}, and the subsequent work of many others\\cite{Kh03, Sus07, KR08a, KR08b, MS09}, Webster categorified",
